	(text "+5V_OR: USB alone powers +3V3 and the logic, not the +5V rail or the +-15 V stage. TPS2116 SLVSEH8 7.6.1: MODE on VIN1, divider VIN1 to PR1 sets the changeover."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 178 0)
		(effects
